{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24598","headline":"闲坐看书贻诸少年 · 白居易","name":"闲坐看书贻诸少年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨砌长寒芜，风庭落秋果。\n窗间有闲叟，尽日看书坐。\n书中见往事，历历知福祸。\n多取终厚亡，疾驱必先堕。\n劝君少干名，名爲锢身鏁。\n劝君少求利，利是焚身火。\n我心知已久，吾道无不可。\n所以雀罗门，不能寂寞我。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}